OL,3,ATrans people should use hospital spaces
OL,4,Aaccording to biological sex, NHS
OL,5,AEngland says
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrevious NHSE guidance suggested
OL,8,Fpatients and staff could be
OL,9,Faccommodated on wards or use facilities
OL,10,Fbased on their gender identity.
